y ,0)$ | $0$ | $(0,2)$ | $2$ | $(2,\\infty )$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Test Point | $-1$ |  | $1$ |  | $3$ |\n| ${f}^{′}$ | $+$ | $0$ | $-$ | $0$ | $+$ |\n| $f$ | $↗$ | max | $↘$ | min | $↗$ |\n\nSo, we conclude that $f(x)$ has a relative maximum at $x=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303602 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303603 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303604 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303605 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303606 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1041 "selection" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1104 #edb/ref 17592186303604 13194139534690 true] [17592186303601 1110 #uuid "3376b74f-267c-5c52-9ee9-bb0b7ce9b385" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303602 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303602 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534690 true] [17592186303602 1111 #uuid "6c801277-a1c8-5edd-bf38-9ac705fdc6f4" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303603 1034 "I only" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534690 true] [17592186303603 1111 #uuid "f7d45fe2-aea5-508a-b5de-7fcc578dbedc" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303604 1034 "III only" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534690 true] [17592186303604 1111 #uuid "c1e6e92c-686e-5c42-ad70-72f9c74740a7" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303605 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303605 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534690 true] [17592186303605 1111 #uuid "b4af0341-d7f9-5cab-bdb7-0fbffef2ea38" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303606 1034 "II only" 13194139534690 true] [17592186303606 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534690 true] [17592186303606 1111 #uuid "dc8a7058-9b41-5eb8-aea3-da5086245ff5" 13194139534690 true] [1759218630